docs {
  # GS HRMS API — Bruno collection

  1. Pick the **Local** environment (top right).
  2. Run **Auth → Sign in as persona**. Change `persona` in the environment to switch role.
  3. Run any other request. The session cookie is reused automatically.

  Every write request sends `Origin: {{origin}}` — the API rejects writes from other origins (CSRF protection).
  Full guide: docs/api-guide.md
}
